visnyk (0.4.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Telegram media broadcasts now use batch-resolved users for all batch
    sizes and remove newly imported contacts before sending.
  * Honor repeated Telegram flood waits during contact import and cleanup;
    surface cleanup errors while preserving WhatsApp delivery.

 -- Visnyk Team <team@visnyk.local>  Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200

visnyk (0.4.0-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Telegram bulk sends now batch-import contacts (20 per chunk) instead
    of per-number contacts.resolvePhone, avoiding the resolvePhone rate
    limit that dropped Telegram delivery by timeout on large batches.
    Broadcast and direct paths both use the batch-resolved fast path.

 -- Visnyk Team <team@visnyk.local>  Mon, 13 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200

visnyk (0.3.0-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Broadcast file attachments: 1 file per batch (photo/video/audio up
    to 16MB, documents up to 100MB), message template as caption.
    Texts over the 1024 caption limit go bare-file plus chunked
    follow-ups (TG 4096, WA chunked), WA audio caption fallback.
    Attachment chip in compose UI, [file: name] tag in history.

 -- Visnyk Team <team@visnyk.local>  Fri, 11 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200

visnyk (0.2.0-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Telegram resolve-first send (no address-book pollution), parallel
    WA/TG delivery with per-channel pacing and full FLOOD_WAIT handling.
    Dead-session circuit breaker, background health monitor with cached
    status. Bulk paste auto-tidies numbers into one column. Broadcast
    delivers to all available messengers. Delay 8-15s + jitter, logging
    and history preserved.

 -- Visnyk Team <team@visnyk.local>  Sun, 07 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200

visnyk (0.1.1-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Direct send: added Send WA and Send TG buttons alongside
    broadcast to all. Direct send targets a single messenger without
    fallback and reports contact not found in WhatsApp/Telegram or
    send failure. Delay 8-15s + jitter, logging and history preserved.
    Broadcast now delivers to all available messengers (was first
    available). History shows multiple channels with "all" indicator.

 -- Visnyk Team <team@visnyk.local>  Fri, 05 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200

visnyk (0.1.0-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Initial release: broadcast messenger for WA, TG, Viber with Wails,
    encrypted storage.

